[statement]
Reduced from Alpine v3.24 (`main` and `community`, 2026-11-08), asked for
`kmail`, over the records the request can reach and those whose
`install_if` names one of them. No condition takes part: apk installs
`kwallet` alone, though the walk reaches `dbus:org.freedesktop.Secrets`,
for which `gnome-keyring` ranks first, long before `so:libKF6Wallet.so.6`,
which only `kwallet` provides. The carried `xdg-utils` is decided before
any provided name, and before it `so:libQt6PrintSupport.so.6`, whose one
candidate `qt6-qtbase-x11` needs it; before that, the names that would
require a name `qt6-qtbase-x11` provides, among them
`so:libKF6Wallet.so.6`, since `kwallet` needs `so:libQt6Gui.so.6`.
`kwallet` then answers `dbus:org.freedesktop.Secrets`
(`decision-order/a-requirer-s-requirers-are-decided-first`). Without any
one dependency entry here, apk installs `gnome-keyring` too.

